{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19757","headline":"长安羁旅行 · 孟郊","name":"长安羁旅行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十日一理发，每梳飞旅尘。\n三旬九过饮，每食唯旧贫。\n万物皆及时，独余不觉春。\n失名谁肯访，得意争相亲。\n直木有恬翼，静流无躁鳞。\n始知喧竞场，莫处君子身。\n野策藤竹轻，山蔬薇蕨新。\n潜歌归去来，事外风景真。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19757.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19757","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}